# Quality contract

State project-specific invariants that can reject a change. Prefer executable checks and canonical
examples over adjectives.

## Correctness

- Every changed behavior has acceptance evidence at the closest user-visible boundary.
- Bug fixes reproduce the failure before implementation when a deterministic test is possible.
- Protected acceptance tests change only through a recorded task-contract revision.

